{"articleNo":"2718","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2718&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 연계전공 이수신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.15","hit":"12275","attachments":[{"name":"연계전공이수신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2718&attachNo=2679"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011학년도 연계전공 이수신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">2011학년도 연계전공 이수 신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 희망</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 1. 18(화) ~ 1. 20(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><!--StartFragment-->\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 신청 자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">3학기 이상 수료한 모든 재학생(비참여 학부･전공의<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;학생은 재정</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">지원 등 혜택 없으나 연계전공 자격은 주어짐)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3.선발 자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">신청자가 정원을 초과할 경우 다음 각호의 기준을<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;순차적으로 적용<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 참여학생<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직전 학기까지 이수한 성적의 평점평균<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 취득 학점 수<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 취득 과목 수<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\"></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 선발확정 : 2011. 1. 27(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 연계전공 명칭 및 이수 정원<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"281\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">연계전공 명칭(영문명)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이수</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">정원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"283\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"47\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">참여 학부(과,전공)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"281\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">그린에너지 소재 연계전공<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(Major of Green Energy Materials)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">45</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"283\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기계공학부, 정보나노소재공학전공,&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">고분자공학전공, 응용화학전공</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"281\" height=\"51\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">그린에너지 시스템 연계전공<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(Major of Green Energy Systems)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"65\" height=\"51\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">45</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"283\" height=\"51\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">전자공학부, 기계공학부,&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">산업시스템공학전공, 환경공학전공</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 99.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -99.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 제출서류 : 연계전공이수신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 신청장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">소속 학부(과)장의 추천을 받아 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">행정실</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(공동실습관 401호, ☏478-7949)에 신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">8. 교육과정 이수<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 공학교육인증 : 적용하지 않음<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복수전공 또는 부전공과 함께 이수할 수 없음<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 연계전공 이수 승인 전에 연계전공 참여 전공에서 이수한 연계전공<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교과목은 연계전공 이수 교과목으로 인정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 교육과정 이수 : 36학점(필수 12학점, 선택 24학점)<span style=\"HWP-TAB: 1\">&nbsp;\n</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium n